        "id": "A5",
        "text": "com.apple.security.application-groups is PRESENT on the two PRODUCTION iOS bundles — the iOS host and the iOS provider — with exactly the matrix array and no team prefix; the App Group record literals are iOS-style on both platforms. The iOS probe host and the iOS probe provider are NOT in scope here: rule G4's probeRule withholds the key from them and A18 requires it absent, so a probe bundle that carries it fails A18 rather than passing A5"
      },
