        "text": "every macOS development profile — the four Mac Development profiles, which are exactly the profiles Ceremony C1 authorizes — carries ProvisionedDevices containing this Mac, and that list equals the device set this contract declares for the same target at profiles[].development.devices. This is the macOS branch only; it is never inherited by an iOS profile"
